WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.280
Here I go!

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:05.250
What?!

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.190
Sachi, you're B-rank?

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.470
That's amazing.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:12.080
He just takes it so seriously, you know?

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.840
You doing what needs doing?

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.240
Don't be dumb.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.450
We each have partners of our own, 
so we're over all that.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.490
And if we make A-rank, 
we'll change partners, anyway.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.750
No way!

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.390
I couldn't take it!

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.680
I'd be so depressed if Ryou-kun 
were here at this school!

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:33.290
If Ryou-kun made it to A-rank and 
lived with lots of different girls,

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.840
I'd never be able to stand it!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.050
There's NegaNatsu again.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.920
You love Ryou-kun way too much.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.670
It's not that easy to get to A-rank.

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.610
It's rough enough just sharing 
a room with a total stranger,

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.520
but you have to pretend to be married, too.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.220
But, I mean...

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:51.340
Ryou-kun is just so hot!

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.200
Keep it down, you lot!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.070
Watch the game!

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.470
Yes, sir.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.100
Over here! Cover!

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.910
Are you staring at Sakurazaka-san again,

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.440
Jiro-chan?

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.220
Shut up.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.180
Wow!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.190
Now that's an ikemen.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:38.470
It's like he's completely different 
from us on a biological level.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:42.630
By the way, did you hear the 
rumor about Sakurazaka-san?

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:44.740
A rumor?

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:52.740
<i>What percentage does "like" have 
to hit before you can call it "love"?</i>

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.850
<i>It's criminal to be so shy</i>

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:07.730
<i>Intelligence and wild fancies, 
tick tock, just pick a mood</i>

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:10.020
<i>A drizzle from a patch of blue sky</i>

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.300
<i>No less than supreme</i>

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:16.710
<i>A maiden's heart zigzags, 
cute and invincible</i>

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.320
<i>The wild ringing of bells</i>

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:26.430
<i>What percentage does "like" have 
to hit before you can call it "love"?</i>

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:30.110
<i>Hold me so tightly that I fall asleep</i>

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:35.660
<i>A daydream that seems like fiction</i>

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:38.720
<i>Give me a kiss that breaks 
the expectant silence of the play</i>

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.120
<i>Give that indecision a tight embrace, too</i>

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.740
<i>My heart hurts and hurts,</i>

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:48.630
<i>racing unpredictably 
with joy and excitement</i>

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.110
<i>It's TRUE FOOL LOVE! Hold me tight!</i>

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.430
<i>Be brave, my darling</i>

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:57.010
<i>It won't all be happy and fun</i>

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.030
<i>It's all up to us</i>

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.240
<i>ONCE MORE SMILE, TWICE MORE CHIME</i>

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.890
<i>Please look my way, darling</i>

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:13.990
<i>Please notice my pure love for you</i>

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.260
What's this rumor about Minami-kun?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.010
It's still a breaking story, but...

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.000
They say Tenjin isn't going to swap partners.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:26.480
What?

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:27.830
I heard that, too.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:31.400
Even though everyone who reaches 
A-rank switches partners, right?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.770
And they get to keep the points from the 
previous pairing just as they are, too.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:39.770
But this practical is supposed to 
be preparing us for the future,

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.870
so the school probably wants 
us to try various combinations.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.530
But...

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.770
I don't like that.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:50.360
It feels like picking out and 
dropping spouses over and over.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:53.290
You know it isn't like that at all, Akari.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:56.790
At this rate, it might really be possible...

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.440
for those two...

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.140
Everything's fine. 
It's still only the first month.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.760
Akari, will you marry me?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:10.930
No fair!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.560
I want in on this, too! Come on!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.640
Come on!

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:16.280
Just give it a rest already!

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.230
You're the one who needs to give it a rest!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:23.590
What? I want in on this, too! Come on!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.910
Hey, Jiro-chan.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.940
Don't get so down about this.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:33.470
Being the wife of an ikemen 
like Tenjin instead of you

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:35.530
is better for Sakurazaka-san, too!

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.220
Whose side are you on?

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:40.160
That's obvious, isn't it?

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.590
Sakurazaka-san's.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.720
Nay, I am an ally of all women!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.840
Hooray for the hero! Hooray!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.640
He's so cool!

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:28.840
He's amazing!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:39.480
It's just too unfair.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.860
Hey, Jiro-chan! Lookie, lookie! 
What d'you think, huh? How's it look?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.640
When I said that, we gained points.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.360
What? For real?

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.830
Jiro-kun!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.560
Shiori?

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:53.350
It's hot today, isn't it?

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.370
Yeah.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:55.250
Jiro-kun?

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:58.720
You seem kind of down. 
Is it about the practical?

00:05:58.720 --> 00:05:59.280
Huh?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.250
Oh, you fought with Watanabe-san 
again, didn't you?

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.260
It's not like that.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.640
Really? I'm glad.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:14.380
Watanabe-san is a good girl, 
so don't cause too much trouble for her.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:20.620
<i>If I told her right now that 
she's the reason I'm stressing...</i>

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:23.650
<i>What face would she make?</i>

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.280
Thanks. It was a request from Minami-kun.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.380
Jiro-kun?

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.280
Hey, Shiori...

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:34.910
Are you going to stay...

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.020
by Tenjin's side forever?

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:43.790
Ugh! This is seriously unbelievable!

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.800
Why just me? All of us were talking.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.420
And these are so dusty!

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.480
Watanabe?

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.050
Huh?

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:57.060
Huh? M-Mina— Why?!

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:17.780
Huh?

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:20.250
That was close.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.210
Sorry. I shouldn't have just 
talked to you out of nowhere.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:27.760
Th-Thanks for saving me. I'm fine now.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.460
Sure thing.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.710
Wh-Why are you here, anyway?

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.970
They asked me to put away the balls.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.970
Oh... I see.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.730
<i>What do I do? My heart's pounding.</i>

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:42.730
<i>He'll hear it.</i>

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.610
I'm really sorry about that.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.110
You're not hurt, are you?

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.460
No.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.000
<i>That's a relief...</i>

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:57.530
<i>Minami-kun still makes my heart race.</i>

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:01.540
<i>Huh? A relief?</i>

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:02.920
<i>Why?</i>

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.040
Let's get this cleanup over with.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:10.050
<i>At this rate, it might really be possible...</i>

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.550
<i>for those two...</i>

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:12.550
Mi...

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.090
Minami-kun!

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.680
Um... are...

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.680
A-Are you going to...

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:25.440
stay with Sakurazaka-san... forever?

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:29.690
I might.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:34.120
If she says she's all right 
with that, then I might.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:36.560
Things <i>are</i> going well right now.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:42.290
<i>Oh.</i>

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:46.860
<i>So I do love him after all.</i>

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.090
Watanabe?

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.600
S-Sorry!

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.220
It's just so dusty in here.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.740
I think I might've gotten 
something in my eye.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:06.480
M-Minami-kun?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.470
Watanabe.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.820
Look me in the eyes.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.640
Jiro-chan!

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.060
Sheesh.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:21.240
I asked him to help me close all the windows.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:23.370
Aha.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:25.060
Jiro—

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.510
...chaaaan...

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.010
Um...

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:37.550
I dunno.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:41.480
Switching partners isn't something 
I can decide on my own.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.780
O-Oh, right! Yeah, you're right.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:45.850
Sorry for asking such a dumb question.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.290
A-And Tenjin's pretty amazing, right?

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.800
But...

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:55.840
But if you made it up to A-rank,

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:57.030
then I...

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.590
Never mind!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:01.640
We need to get changed 
before the next class starts!

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.660
Shiori!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.920
I'll make it to A-rank!

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.660
And when that happens...

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.650
If you're A-rank, too...

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:10.790
then...

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.820
Shiori...

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:14.810
C-Can you and I—

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:17.800
Jiro-chan!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.180
This is huge!

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:23.430
As huge as if you bought packs in bulk 
and all the cards inside were secret ones!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.470
Listen to me!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.920
I'm begging you. Leave right now.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:31.090
If you don't, I will very 
likely send you to your grave.

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:32.440
As a living sacrifice?!

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:34.820
Jiro-kun?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.060
Kamo, kamo...

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.320
Sorry about that.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.210
It's nothing. Never mind.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.040
I see.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.330
Wait, were you in the 
middle of something here, too?

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:46.250
That's right. And what do 
you mean by "here, too"?

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.050
Well, I just saw Tenjin and 
Akari-chan over there—

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:50.480
What about us?

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.330
Huh?

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.600
What're you guys talking about?

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.980
N-Nothing!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.890
<i>Huh? Why...</i>

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.280
<i>What is this atmosphere?</i>

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:11.350
Huh? What battlefield is this?

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.230
<b>Preview</b>

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:15.230
<i>I'm trapped by an accident 
that wasn't my fault!</i>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.110
<b>Escape</b>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.110
<b>Intervention</b>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.110
<b>Friendship</b>

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.110
<b>Quick Joke</b>

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.180
<i>The only action left to me is to summon...</i>

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:18.360
<i>a monster!</i>

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.780
<i><b>Attack
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h9999
Defense
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h0001</b></i>

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.360
Come!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.020
Strongest of All Quick Jokes!

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.920
<i>Oh, hang on. There are girls here.</i>

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:28.120
<i>I'll get majorly burned, and that'll 
be the end of my high school life.</i>

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:33.130
Normies

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:30.460
<i>Next time, "I Die Inside."</i>

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:33.130
<b>Next Time</b>

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:33.130
<b>I Die Inside</b>

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:33.130
<i>Kamo Sadaharu, standing by!</i>

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:37.410
Come to think of it, has anyone 
called me by name in this anime?

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.880
Oh, Kamo. I've been looking for you.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:43.840
Oh, sorry. Your name is Kamo, isn't it?

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.360
It is. It's Kamo Sadaharu.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:49.190
Here. The key to the storage room.

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:52.480
The teacher said to give it to you. 
You're on the PE committee, right?

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.420
Oh. Yes, that's right.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.400
All yours,

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:58.750
Kamo.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:11:59.560
<i>My heart.</i>

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:01.670
Oh, right.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:05.100
Shiori, did you turn in the form 
to continue our marriage practical?

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.740
No, not yet.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.160
I forgot, too.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.760
Then should we go together at lunch?

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.120
It's due today, right?

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.920
Yeah. Where do we have to go again?

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.090
Jiro-kun, we're going on ahead, okay?

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.410
S-Sure.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.410
I've got work today, so...

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:24.440
So you won't need dinner, right?

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.980
Oh, that's right. I wanted to ask you...

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:32.320
W-Well, I guess I'll go return the key.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:45.950
<i>Oh, dear. What kind of face is that?</i>

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:50.450
<i>Whatever it is, good luck, my friend.</i>

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.440
Listen, Watanabe...

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:56.670
We should get back.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.950
We'll be late for class.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:00.740
Right.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.580
Huh? Where's Akari?

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:10.970
She left early.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.360
She said we can just say it's 
a cold and leave it at that.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.140
What? That's hilarious.

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:18.820
She went home?

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.860
<b>Lancia</b>

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.860
m 0 0 l 410 0 l 410 60 l 0 60

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.860
<b>You love Chloris, don't you? 
Why don't you just hurry up and go to her?!</b>

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:30.990
m 0 0 l 360 0 l 360 60 l 0 60

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:30.990
<b>Leave Lancia here and go see Chloris. 
It's no good. You just can't leave Lancia on her own.</b>

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.080
Wander, wander.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.790
Kamo

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.600
Wander, wander, wander.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.750
m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 90 l 0 90

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.750
<b>Kamo is wandering
nearby, as though he wants 
to tell Jiro something.</b>

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:37.750
Wander, wander, wander, wander, wander.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.750
Kamo

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.750
m 0 0 l 360 0 l 360 60 l 0 60

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.750
<b>Leave Lancia here and go see Chloris. 
It's no good. You just can't leave Lancia on her own.</b>

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:41.600
Ack!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.260
Loom.

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:49.220
What are you doing?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:50.800
Well...

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.770
I was just thinking, 
"Huh, Tenjin's still here."

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:59.010
Man, what is it with all this 
"Tenjin," "Tenjin," "Tenjin"?

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:00.520
Just spit it out already!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.270
Well...

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:03.570
Should I really say it, though?

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:07.570
I mean, Tenjin was nice 
enough to remember my name.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.530
And he kinda smelled nice.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.770
I remember your name, too!

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:13.490
Kamo, Kamo, Kamo, Kamo, Kamo—

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.880
What white-fleshed fish 
tastes great as tempura?

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:16.590
Huh?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.510
K-Kissing happened.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.480
Huh? With you?

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:31.850
Ha. Me? When even my 
family's pet cat bites me?

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.240
S-Sorry.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.200
Between Akari-chan and Tenjin!

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.500
I happened to see it!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.270
I don't know what led up to it, 
or what their relationship is, though.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.350
Akari-chan seemed embarrassed.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:48.390
So I'm certain of it. That was—

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:49.360
And?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:50.780
Huh?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.160
If it's true, then what?

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.980
But, I mean... you...

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.020
Well, I guess you're right.

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:02.540
Even if it's true, it's got 
nothing to do with you.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.050
<i>I see.</i>

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.020
<i>With Tenjin-sama, huh?</i>

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.810
<i>I'm happy for you. 
Congratulations, Watanabe.</i>

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.810
<b>Lancia</b>

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.380
I'm not even Team Lancia, am I?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:39.790
<i>Today, we're going to limit ourselves 
to affordable cosmetics.</i>

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:37.290
I'm back.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:43.790
<i>These days, there are lots of really 
amazing low-priced products.</i>

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.060
<i>First, there's this primer that 
I've been super hooked on lately.</i>

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:46.060
I heard you have a cold.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.070
<i>It's great for toning, 
and it has lavender undertones.</i>

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:51.800
<i>I tend to have my hair black, 
so using a primer with purple tones...</i>

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.320
<i>Oh, that's right! Speaking of hair...</i>

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:57.310
<i>Ta-da! Nuanced Fancy Water for...</i>

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.310
Do you have a fever?

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.420
<i>This lip balm has beautifying 
essences in it! It's godly!</i>

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:02.280
<i>I'm seriously buying it on repeat!</i>

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:05.280
<i>I recommend number 7 for people 
with blue tones to their skin!</i>

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:08.220
<i>It's a tinted balm, so it'll 
last even through a kiss!</i>

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.070
I'm so sorry that I'm not Tenjin.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.150
<i>If you have occasion to, that is!</i>

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.320
What?

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:16.570
Why are you suddenly bringing up Minami-kun?

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:17.420
Well?

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.060
Oh, uh...

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:19.750
What?

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.500
It's nothi—

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.580
Tell me.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.140
Uh...

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:31.590
You and Tenjin apparently got a lot 
closer during PE. I heard about it.

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.190
I was happy for you.

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:37.200
Happy? Why now, though?

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.850
Yeah, I was happy that I got to talk to him, but...

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:42.850
So if you're happy, you'll kiss someone?

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.280
Huh? I don't know what you're talking about.

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:47.050
There's no need to hide it.

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.700
It's amazing that you could embrace 
like that in the storeroom.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:53.270
If you and Tenjin are gonna end up together,

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.610
I'm gonna cheer you on.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.820
It's cause for celebration.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.340
Wait, that's—

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.650
No... Yeah.

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:01.460
It's cause for celebration.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.630
Oh, man! This is hilarious!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.150
Huh?

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:16.650
That must've been when I had 
him check my eye for dust!

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:19.550
That misunderstanding is, like, 
straight out of a manga!

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.230
<i>I will send him to his grave!</i>

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.890
██████████████████████████████████

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.890
<b>I will send him to his grave!!</b>

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.890
<b>KILL</b>

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:24.700
And anyway, that kind of thing doesn't 
just happen out of the blue, right?

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.900
I'm actually hurt right now 
because he's not switching partners.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:30.040
Why would you even believe that? Sad!

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:33.690
Because... I know how hard you're trying.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:34.900
I told you...

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.600
I'm working hard because 
he just won't look my way.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.900
Well, yeah, but...

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.980
I mean, you're giving it all you've got.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.660
Why shouldn't it pay off a little?

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.170
What an idiot.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.170
It's super...

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:51.910
hilarious...

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.300
Watanabe!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:04.020
Hey! What are you looking at?

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.060
Let go...

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:07.380
You idiot...

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.060
Don't!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.320
Look away!

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:32.710
I-I looked away!

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.110
I can't see anything now!

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.260
I panicked and ended up doing that.

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:09.640
I don't know what the right thing to do is!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:14.000
I'm not the kind of guy who encounters 
women crying all that often!

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:17.570
<i>Before, Watanabe was 
sleeping, so I was safe,</i>

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:19.840
<i>but this time I have no excuse!</i>

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:22.430
<i>Of course she'd hate being held like that</i>

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.510
<i>by a guy she doesn't love!</i>

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.510
Jiro, the bath is free.

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:29.020
Mine aren't dry, so I borrowed this.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.270
Huh? Borrowed what?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.020
Your shirt.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.680
<i>Whoa! Are you serious?!</i>

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.060
<i>The "boyfriend shirt" thing hits this hard?!</i>

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.780
<b>Vanilla &
Chocolate Bar</b>

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:58.170
<i>And she's getting super close!</i>

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:01.670
<i>What changed all of a sudden?
There's usually a longer break!</i>

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.600
<i>Doing this after what just happened...</i>

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.680
<i>is gonna make me remember 
the physical sensations!</i>

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:10.360
L-Look, I know you're probably like this 
because it's just me, but be more careful.

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:12.420
I don't exactly know where to look.

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:14.990
Is your heart racing, Repressed-kun?

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:17.840
No! I'm used to seeing stuff like this now.

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.320
Day after day...

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:23.340
Liar.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:27.080
I can feel it right here, pounding really hard.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:30.930
Jiro?

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.620
Earthly Desires Begone!!!!!!!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.620
Earthly desires begone Earthly desires begone
 Earthly desires begone Earthly desires begone
 Earthly desires begone Earthly desires begone
 Earthly desires begone Earthly desires begone
 Earthly desires begone Earthly desires begone
 Earthly desires begone Earthly desires begone
 Earthly... desires... begone...

