00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.590
I think I'll succumb before 
I ring it 108 times.

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:39.560
Huh?

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.330
Jiro, you're so weird.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.760
Don't make fun of me.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:51.410
You should only dress like that for Tenjin.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.400
You jealous?

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.990
You're kind of adorable, Jiro!

00:20:55.990 --> 00:21:00.110
You know, dressed like that, 
you really will catch a cold!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:05.010
Jiro, you believed that I kissed him, right?

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:08.620
I'm not that easy, you know.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:12.050
I-I said I was sorry about that.

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:15.210
You think I've gone around and 
kissed all kinds of people.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:17.010
That's not what I—

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:17.940
Smooch.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.570
It's just you, Jiro.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:26.380
That was my first, so yours 
is the only kiss I know.

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:30.580
Seriously, you're such an idiot!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:33.260
S-Suddenly kissing me on the mouth like that...

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:35.320
Those were some serious "I'm a virgin" vibes!

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:37.120
You went in too hard, 
and you were lousy at it!

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.470
Having that as my first kiss is just wrong!

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:40.790
What <i>was</i> that, anyway?

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:43.450
That was really and truly my first kiss!

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:44.720
Are you even listening?

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.400
Hey, are you alive?

