It's my turn!

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:58.120
<b>Intervention</b>

00:23:56.500 --> 00:23:57.590
Effect, activate!

00:23:57.590 --> 00:23:58.120
Intervention!

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:01.540
<i>Everyone, please don't fight because of me!</i>

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:05.260
I'm so glad I didn't do that!

